{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "写一份复盘",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 89.22,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "认出模式之后，还要会写复盘。",
   "spoken": "认出模式之后，还要会写复盘。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "先写一句话摘要，损失多少，是否追回。",
   "spoken": "先写一句话摘要，损失多少，是否追回。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 4.71,
   "speechEnd": 7.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "再写时间线，漏洞在哪个版本引入，攻击交易，发现与响应。",
   "spoken": "再写时间线，漏洞在哪个版本引入，攻击交易，发现与响应。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 8.44,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 8.44,
   "speechEnd": 14.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "根因分两层，直接原因是代码哪一行，根本原因是流程哪一环缺失。",
   "spoken": "根因分两层，直接原因是代码哪一航，根本原因是流程哪一环缺失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 14.42,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 14.518,
   "speechEnd": 20.226
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "最后写，哪个关口本可以拦住它，被打破的不变量，还有防御清单。",
   "spoken": "最后写，哪个关口本可以拦住它，被打破的不变量，还有防御清单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 20.64,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 20.64,
   "speechEnd": 25.799
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "练习时，每周选一起，只看交易哈希，用调用树找根因，再对照复盘，找出自己漏掉的步骤。",
   "spoken": "练习时，每周选一起，只看交易哈希，用掉用树找根因，再对照复盘，找出自己漏掉的步骤。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 26.22,
   "dur": 8.88,
   "speechStart": 26.22,
   "speechEnd": 34.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "事件库只是线索，金额和根因要回到一手资料核对，复现只在本地或分叉环境里做。",
   "spoken": "事件库只是线索，金额和根因要回到一手资料核对，复现只在本地或分叉环境里做。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 35.32,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 35.32,
   "speechEnd": 42.851
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 43.3,
   "dur": 1.44,
   "speechStart": 43.3,
   "speechEnd": 44.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "写代码的人，拿八个识别信号，查一遍自己最近的改动。",
   "spoken": "写代码的人，拿八个识别信号，查一遍自己最近的改动。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 44.96,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 44.96,
   "speechEnd": 49.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "管资产的人，数一数控制资金的钥匙有几把，有没有时间锁。",
   "spoken": "管资产的人，属一属控制资金的钥匙有几把，有没有时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 49.66,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 49.753,
   "speechEnd": 54.952
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 55.4,
   "dur": 1.36,
   "speechStart": 55.4,
   "speechEnd": 56.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "修过的漏洞会回来，是因为环境变了，新链，新分叉，新版本，新组合，检查却没跟上。",
   "spoken": "修过的漏洞会回来，是因为环境变了，新链，新分叉，新版本，新组合，检查却没跟上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 56.98,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 56.98,
   "speechEnd": 65.149
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "读旧事故，能帮我们提前认出下一起，前提是记住模式和信号，而不是名字。",
   "spoken": "读旧事故，能帮我们提前认出下一起，前提是记住模式和信号，而不是名字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 65.6,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 65.7,
   "speechEnd": 72.108
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "也要说清边界，档案馆只认得出旧模式，真正的新漏洞，这里还没有展品。",
   "spoken": "也要说清边界，档案馆只认得出旧模式，真正的新漏洞，这里还没有展品。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 72.54,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 72.637,
   "speechEnd": 79.025
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "同样的错误，会换个名字再来，认出它，靠的是模式。",
   "spoken": "同样的错误，会换个名字再来，认出它，靠的是模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg6-14.wav",
   "start": 79.48,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 79.575,
   "speechEnd": 83.631
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-15",
   "text": "下一集讲 2026 年的签名路径安全。",
